### MUTATES DATA: load deterministic demo data
POST {{baseUrl}}/simulations/demo-seed
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### MUTATES DATA: run a short simulated meter scenario
POST {{baseUrl}}/simulations/run
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenario": "normal",
  "intervals": 2,
  "intervalMinutes": 15,
  "meterExternalIds": ["{{testMeterExternalId}}"],
  "startAt": "2026-07-04T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### MUTATES DATA: aggregate hourly usage
POST {{baseUrl}}/analytics/aggregate
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "periodType": "hour"
}

### Dashboard summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Dashboard overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/overview?buildingId={{testBuildingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Dashboard trends
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/trends?buildingId={{testBuildingId}}&utilityType=water
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Dashboard building breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/buildings?utilityType=water
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Dashboard unit rankings
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/units?buildingId={{testBuildingId}}&utilityType=water
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Dashboard device health
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/device-health
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Dashboard alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Get utility rates
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings/rates
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### MUTATES DATA: update utility rates
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/settings/rates
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waterPerGallon": 0.012,
  "electricPerKwh": 0.18
}
